# SEED VISIBILITY, both directions (Lesson: seed the delta AND the round-0 snapshot).
# The ONLY enabling premise here is the initialization seed: top IN S(A) for every A.
# - Seeds written only to the STORE  -> every queue empty, instant false `fixpoint`.
# - Seeds written only to the QUEUE  -> S(A) empty during round 0, CR1 cannot fire.
# Expect: entails A subseteq C for EVERY class A in the signature.

@prefix :    <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:A a owl:Class . :B a owl:Class . :C a owl:Class .
owl:Thing rdfs:subClassOf :C .
